  "_comment": "AUTHORITATIVE furniture catalog (room.lua builds Room.CATALOG from this; the Lua DEFAULTS are only an emergency fallback). Fields: w/h footprint cells, place ground|wall, name, collH/collW/collD collision, surface+surfaceH (stackables sit on top), stackOn (may ride a surface), computer/fixed/interact behavior flags, emissiveColor [r,g,b,scale] = the emissivePart's glow (default a dim warm white), model = GLB stem override (Models/<id>.glb is auto-used when present), screen {tex,emit} + accent [r,g,b] arcade variants (tex resolves via A.SCREEN), picture resolves via A.PICTURE, wallGlb {file,h,axis,flip} wall-mounted GLB metadata, legacyMirror mirrors into the v1 furniture array, fit = the share of its footprint the model fills (0.92 when absent), shop = sold in the coin shop (3D thumbnail baked at onStart). New items: add an entry AND its id to _order plus a GLB in Models/ (a plain placeholder box renders until the model exists). Display names are the skin's ITEM_<ID> strings (Locales/<code>/), shared with the coin shop and the vault.",
